  "summary_en": "The UK Government Digital Service's AI Playbook (February 2025) is guidance for public-sector bodies that use AI. It updates the Generative AI Framework for HMG and sets out 10 principles. It also covers buying AI, ethics, legal issues, data protection, security and governance, and includes public-sector case studies. It covers software AI only, not robotics.",
